WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Who created the value—and who gets it? Trace contributions, rights, risk and benefit distribution.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Trace every contribution.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Name the knowledge source.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Attach rights and agreements.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Test who bears the risk.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Distribute benefits by design.
